== Equipment ==
*Armor:
** Survivor or Blessed sigs and a rune of Restoration.
*Weapons:
** Shocking daggers of Fortitude (Use most of the time)
** Shocking daggers of Enchanting (Use when you're about to open your chain with Gust)
** 40/20/20 Air staff (Use while casting enchantments)
** Shield sets (+10 vs damage type)

== Usage ==
* Use Gust to start your chain if your target is moving or attacking. If not, use shock.
* Use Gust on your allies being attacked in melee to lineback from afar and give them an IMS.
* Alternatively use it offensively on one of your frontline.

== Counters ==
* Anti-melee.

== Notes ==
* The only time you should self cast Gust is if there isn't one of your allies in range. Spread the love.
* Foes suffer two damage packets from Gust when targeting yourself.